    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_growth_rate_dynamics" kindref="compound">GrowthRateDynamics</ref> class, a mass-based dynamics modeling growth rate. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains the definition of <ref refid="class_growth_rate_dynamics" kindref="compound">GrowthRateDynamics</ref>, which represents dynamics based on the growth rate of organisms. It inherits from <ref refid="class_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">MassBasedDynamics</ref> and implements temperature, moisture, and relative humidity dependent growth. </para>
